    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496590/extras/4d414363c010fdf380e3e1793b351244.avif?t=1752290271\" /></span><br><br>Dive into the captivating world of <strong>Untraveled Lands: Chantico</strong>, a unique mix of card-based gameplay, survival craft, and roguelike elements, inspired by the exciting adventures of jungle explorers. Set against the rich mystical backdrop of Mesoamerican cultures, legends, and relics, this game takes you deep into jungles hidden in time and mystery. Immerse yourself in a retro ambiance evoking the 1930s, wrapped up in an enthralling adventure that calls to the explorer within.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496590/extras/6e2083b1d374744fda3a27a9d7842c8d.webp?t=1752290271\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496590/extras/046df6bbf0c0b93b874dc3cae8d4de07.poster.avif?t=1752290271\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496590/extras/046df6bbf0c0b93b874dc3cae8d4de07.webm?t=1752290271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Survival Crafting:</strong> Master survival with intuitive card-based crafting. Build shelters, craft tools, and ensure your village thrives amidst the jungle's challenges.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496590/extras/61e1fa251d879998393d6789a09de9df.webp?t=1752290271\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496590/extras/d35e1b79e4b380a0de8a54685be08a96.poster.avif?t=1752290271\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496590/extras/d35e1b79e4b380a0de8a54685be08a96.webm?t=1752290271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Exploration:</strong> Discover hidden temples and ancient relics as you navigate through lush, uncharted territories. Each card reveals new paths and secrets in your quest for home.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496590/extras/2935329f8d19c44c88f757379ad12974.webp?t=1752290271\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496590/extras/4ffd23ddf85234c1131bbb4f3b8eb0e5.poster.avif?t=1752290271\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496590/extras/4ffd23ddf85234c1131bbb4f3b8eb0e5.webm?t=1752290271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Story-Driven Adventure:</strong> Embark on a story-driven journey, solving puzzles and uncovering the mysteries of ancient civilizations. Your choices shape the adventure in this card-driven world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496590/extras/b749dd58860c9cf5b05e065266a47182.webp?t=1752290271\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496590/extras/6de45f6508197ad40b3c890364af5e01.poster.avif?t=1752290271\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496590/extras/6de45f6508197ad40b3c890364af5e01.webm?t=1752290271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Dynamic Encounters:</strong> Face off against wild beasts and formidable foes. Assemble a team of allies with cards that bring strategic depth to each encounter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496590/extras/8497134eb231393263200841bf0ddbf0.webp?t=1752290271\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496590/extras/7169c74a3fc2b45e3223d7230d251f67.avif?t=1752290271\" /></span><br><strong>Passionately Crafted:</strong> Immerse yourself in stunning visuals inspired by classic exploration tales, where every card paints a part of this captivating jungle adventure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496590/extras/f648c5017a55adb1bd4d8cc3e5bdc943.webp?t=1752290271\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496590/extras/39f1d0ca40c6525f7b3f43e0dfc8bb70.avif?t=1752290271\" /></span><br><strong>Enhanced Replayability:</strong> Enjoy a new adventure every time with procedurally generated maps and scenarios, ensuring each playthrough is unique and challenging.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496590/extras/cb0ef47785ffe170a5178dd3144e6612.avif?t=1752290271\" /></span>",
